  "idea": "Baserow: the completely free open-source Airtable alternative",
  "text": "Stop paying for Airtable databases just because you hit strict free tier limits. Small teams quickly max out row caps, forcing them to delete historical records or pay steep per-seat fees. Commercial platforms trap your operational data behind escalating pricing tiers as your customer base expands. Baserow provides an open-source relational database with unlimited records, custom fields, and real-time collaboration. You manage complex workflows without artificial data caps.",
